# Virtual environment
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Raw and intermediate data — ~130MB and fully reproducible by re-running the pipeline.
# data/processed/ IS committed so the dashboard runs immediately without a 100-minute API pull.
data/raw/
data/interim/

# Logs
*.log

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.claude/

# Local snapshots taken before risky edits — a safety net, not project history
.snapshots/

# Word autosave locks and per-edit backups
~$*
*.docx.backup*

# The writeup is delivered directly to the reviewer, not published here.
# reports/writeup.md and reports/build_writeup_docx.py remain, so it is reproducible.
reports/*.docx

# LightGBM comparison model: cannot be loaded without lightgbm, which is no longer a runtime
# dependency, and the dashboard never uses it (PRIMARY_MODEL is the logistic regression).
# models/lgbm.pkl is committed (904 KB) so the "logistic beat the gradient-boosted model"
# comparison in the writeup can be checked without a retraining run.

# Private working documents — not part of the submission
AI_USAGE_LOG.md
reports/writeup.md
reports/build_writeup_docx.py
